|passage="Europeans need to get to work '''yesterday''' and to focus," she says. "They have 5-10 years to stand on their own two feet in terms of conventional defence capabilities."|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260304122229/https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cddn002g6qzo}}

