===Preposition===
{{en-head|prep}}

# In the [[inner]] part, spatially; physically [[inside]].
#: {{ux|en|'''within''' her studio}}
#* {{RQ:Poe Works|volume=II|title=Dream|page=40|passage=O God! can I not save / ''One'' from the pitiless wave? / Is ''all'' that we see or seem / But a dream '''within''' a dream?}}
#* {{RQ:Grahame Wind in the Willows|passage=The Rat{{...}} lightly stepped into a little boat which the Mole had not observed. It was painted blue outside and white '''within''', and was just the size for two animals; and the Mole's whole heart went out to it at once{{...}}.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|journal=w:National Geographic|year=1990|month=August|volume=178|number=2|title=Yugoslavia: A House Much Divided|author=Kenneth C. Danforth|page=103
|text=Diplomatic codes that allow Yugoslavia to get along with the rest of the world do not apply '''within''' Yugoslavia.}}
# In the [[scope]] or [[range]] of.
#: {{ux|en|'''within''' his hearing;&nbsp; her  '''within''' five seconds of breaking the record;&nbsp; '''within''' an inch of falling overboard}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2011|author=Tom Fordyce|title=Rugby World Cup 2011: England 12-19 France|url=http://news.bbc.co.uk/sport1/hi/rugby_union/15210221.stm
|passage=England struck back with a fine try from Ben Foden and closed to '''within''' seven points with three minutes left when Mark Cueto capitalised on a break from replacement Matt Banahan.}}
# Before the specified duration ends.
#: {{ux|en|Leave here '''within''' three days.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2012|author=Christoper Zara|title=Tortured Artists: From Picasso and Monroe to Warhol and Winehouse, the Twisted Secrets of the World's Most Creative Minds|section=part 1, chapter 1, {{gbooks|q=within|id=HV4jKhjzMVYC|pg=27}}
|passage=On October 6, 1927, Warner Bros. released ''The Jazz Singer'', the first sound-synched feature film, prompting a technological shift of unprecedented speed and unstoppable force. '''Within''' two years, nearly every studio release was a talkie.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=June 9, 2012|author=Owen Phillips|work=BBC Sport
|title=[http://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/0/football/18138777 Euro 2012: Netherlands 0-1 Denmark]
|passage=And Netherlands, backed by a typically noisy and colourful travelling support, started the second period in blistering fashion and could have had four goals '''within''' 10 minutes}}
#* {{quote-web|en|work=Skip Boring|date=2026-07-25|title=The Last Call of Jo-Anne Pedersen, the Girl Who Vanished From a Payphone|author=Nicholas Muhoro|url=https://skipboring.com/jo-anne-pedersen-vanishing-chilliwack-bc-payphone/|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260726151644/https://skipboring.com/jo-anne-pedersen-vanishing-chilliwack-bc-payphone/|text={{...|Angela later recalled him saying,}} “You’d better get here '''within''' half an hour, or I’m phoning the police.”}}

